 * 1. bag variables can be bound to values of bag valued functions
 * 2. The 'set f(..)=... ' now updates correctly
 *
 * Revision 1.7  2009/11/16 21:54:55  torer
 * Strict use of in over bag (not =)
 *
 * Revision 1.6  2009/11/03 19:57:14  torer
 * Inferring types of materialized bags
 *
 * Revision 1.5  2009/10/30 16:52:53  torer
 * bug in script
